        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Xigmadda Dadka iyo Muujinta Ilaah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walaalayaalow, anna markaan idiin imid, lama iman hadal wanaaggiis ama xigmad, anoo idinku wacdiyaya maraggii laga furay Ilaah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waayo, waxaan goostay inaanan waxba dhexdiinna ka ogaan Ciise Masiix oo ah kan iskutallaabta lagu qodbay maahee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaan idinkula joogay itaaldarro, iyo cabsi, iyo gariir badan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiin hadalkayga iyo wacdigayga kuma aan hadlin hadallo sasabasho iyo xigmad ah, laakiin waxaan ku hadlay tusidda Ruuxa iyo xoogga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inaan rumaysadkiinnu ku tiirsanaan xigmadda dadka, laakiin inuu xoogga Ilaah ku tiirsanaado.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaannu xigmadda kula hadallaa kuwa garashadu ku dhan tahay, taasoo aan ahayn xigmadda wakhtigan, oo aan ahayn xigmadda madaxda wakhtigan oo ah kuwa la baabbi'in doono; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laakiin qarsoonaan ayaannu ugu hadallaa xigmadda Ilaah oo la qariyey, oo Ilaah dunida horteed ka dhigay ammaanteenna aawadeed, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tan madaxda wakhtigan midkoodna aanu garanaynin, waayo, hadday garan lahaayeen, iskutallaabta kuma ay qodbeen Rabbiga ammaanta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laakiin sida qoran,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
